From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wave: bind four-address ports to native peer lifetimes

Restore standard four-address admission, AP_VLAN ownership
and peer replication through native station and netdev lifetimes.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

